title They kicked it over your goal line
intro Red has the ball in front of your goal.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-RF at 35.7, 29.9
  ball with R-RF

step
  caption Red has the ball and is attacking your goal.

step
  caption Red shoots — it misses the net and goes over your goal line.
  ball to -5.3, 10.9
  arrow from R-RF to ball
  draw goal-line left
  duration 1450

question
  prompt Who gets the ball?
  answer Blue
  wrong Red
  wrong Nobody
  wrong Play on
  why Red last touched it over your goal line, so you get the ball.

step
  caption You get a goal kick from the box by your goal.
  B-G to 8.4, 34
  ball with B-G
  draw goal-area left
  banner Goal kick
